{"id":"549b477c8b3e6f4d","group":"93","path":"93/93-prop-kripke-semantics.md","title":"Kripke Semantics","display":"Kripke Semantics","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-prop-kripke-semantics","aliases":["93-prop-kripke-semantics"],"display":"Kripke Semantics","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-kripke-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-prop-kripke-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-prop-kripke-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Kripke Semantics"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f3abfd23a82d3619\" href=\"?note=f3abfd23a82d3619\" title=\"93-df-kripke-model\">93-df-kripke-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"prop-kripke-semantics-—-Kripke-Semantics\">prop-kripke-semantics — Kripke Semantics</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\">\\(\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MNeg}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{MNeg}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MAnd}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{MAnd}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}\\)</span> are the sourced tagged modal constructors.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\">\\(\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\)</span> is the recursively defined local satisfaction relation of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f3abfd23a82d3619\" href=\"?note=f3abfd23a82d3619\" title=\"93-df-kripke-model\">93-df-kripke-model</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\land\\mathfrak M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\n\\land w\\in W\\land p\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93}\\land\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl[(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}p\\leftrightarrow w\\in V(p))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\operatorname{MNeg}_{93}(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\neg(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\varphi))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\operatorname{MAnd}_{93}(\\varphi,\\psi)\n\\leftrightarrow(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\varphi\\land w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\psi))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\forall v\\in W\\;(\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in R\\to v\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\varphi))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\land\\mathfrak M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\n\\land w\\in W\\land p\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93}\\land\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl[(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}p\\leftrightarrow w\\in V(p))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\operatorname{MNeg}_{93}(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\neg(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\varphi))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\operatorname{MAnd}_{93}(\\varphi,\\psi)\n\\leftrightarrow(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\varphi\\land w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\psi))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\forall v\\in W\\;(\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in R\\to v\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\varphi))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This proposition exposes the four defining clauses under their typing hypotheses. Frame validity and model consequence are not conflated with local satisfaction.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"prop-kripke-semantics-—-Kripke-Semantics","text":"prop-kripke-semantics — Kripke Semantics","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"f3abfd23a82d3619","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"f3abfd23a82d3619","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}$ is the recursively defined local satisfaction relation of [[93-df-kripke-model]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MNeg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MAnd}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\land\\mathfrak M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\n\\land w\\in W\\land p\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93}\\land\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\\\\\n&\\to\\Bigl[(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}p\\leftrightarrow w\\in V(p))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\operatorname{MNeg}_{93}(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\neg(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\varphi))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\operatorname{MAnd}_{93}(\\varphi,\\psi)\n\\leftrightarrow(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\varphi\\land w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\psi))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\forall v\\in W\\;(\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in R\\to v\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M}\\varphi))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1692,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["f3abfd23a82d3619"]}